<title>USA: Applied Microsystems stake cut by group.</title>
<headline>Applied Microsystems stake cut by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Onex Corp said it has reduced its stake in Applied Microsystems Corp to 663,360 shares or 9.8 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold 135,000 shares of the Redmond, Washington computer software company between May 16 and May 30 at $7 and $7.125 each.</p>
